<title>JAPAN: Honda Motor and Toyota Motor surge in morning.</title>
<headline>Honda Motor and Toyota Motor surge in morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd and Toyota Motor Corp shares surged in Thursday morning trade, as investors flocked to the issues in a renewed round of blue-chip buying, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0140 GMT, Honda was up 120 yen at 3,770, the third most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse, with turnover of 2.21 million shares. Toyota was up 50 yen at 3,180.</p>
